    },
    "5": {
      "html": "<h2 class=\"f-pixel\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The Tool Box</h2>\n<hr class=\"rule-double\">\n<p class=\"f-mega\" style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Mega for headlines</p>\n<p class=\"f-pixel\">Pixel for subheads</p>\n<p class=\"f-term\" style=\"font-size: 17px;\">Terminal for the robots</p>\n<p class=\"f-serif\">Serif for long reading</p>\n<p class=\"f-sans\">Sans for plain labels</p>\n<p>Courier is the default, with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em> and <u>underline</u>.</p>\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n<div class=\"swatches\">\n<div class=\"pat-2\"></div><div class=\"pat-3\"></div><div class=\"pat-4\"></div><div class=\"pat-5\"></div>\n<div class=\"pat-6\"></div><div class=\"pat-7\"></div><div class=\"pat-8\"></div><div class=\"pat-9\"></div>\n<div class=\"pat-10\"></div><div class=\"pat-11\"></div><div class=\"pat-12\"></div><div class=\"pat-13\"></div>\n<div class=\"pat-14\"></div><div class=\"pat-15\"></div><div class=\"pat-16\"></div><div class=\"pat-1\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pat-bar pat-10\"></div>\n<div class=\"pat-box pat-14\"><div>A <b>pattern box</b>: any of the 16 fills, with a white panel inside for text.</div></div>\n<blockquote class=\"pull\">Pull quotes, too.</blockquote>",
      "css": "p {\n  margin: 3px 0;\n}\n.swatches {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr);\n  gap: 3px;\n  margin: 6px 0;\n}\n.swatches div {\n  height: 16px;\n  border: 1px solid #000;\n}",
      "image": null,
      "imageMode": "none",
      "dotSize": 2,
      "columns": 1,
      "useMaster": true,
      "flow": false,
      "bg": 0
    },
    "6": {
      "html": "<h2 class=\"f-pixel\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Photo Scraps</h2>\n<p>Photocopiers turn grey into mud. Pure black-and-white dots copy cleanly.</p>\n<p>Upload any image and choose <b>Print as</b>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Atkinson</b>: crisp, high contrast, very Macintosh. The cover uses it at <i>chunky</i> dot size.</li>\n<li><b>Floyd–Steinberg</b>: smoother tones. This sphere uses it at <i>fine</i>.</li>\n<li><b>High contrast</b>: for line art.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This page's own CSS floats the image left.</p>",
      "css": ".auto-image {\n  float: left;\n  width: 48%;\n  margin: 2px 8px 4px 0;\n  border: 1px solid #000;\n}\nul {\n  margin: 4px 0 4px 14px;\n}\nli {\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\np {\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\n}",
      "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
      "imageMode": "floyd",
      "dotSize": 1,
      "columns": 1,
      "useMaster": true,
      "flow": false,
      "bg": 0
    },
    "7": {
      "html": "<div class=\"panel-white\">\n<h2 class=\"f-pixel\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Fold It</h2>\n<p>This page's background is pattern 13; the text sits on a white panel.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Print the PDF on one letter sheet, landscape.</li>\n<li>Fold it in half both ways, then into eighths. Unfold.</li>\n<li>Cut the dashed ✂ line in the middle.</li>\n<li>Fold it the long way and push the ends in until it opens into a diamond.</li>\n<li>Flatten into a book, cover on top.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"col-note f-term\">The top row prints upside down on purpose. See the Print Sheet preview.</div>\n</div>",
      "css": ".panel-white {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 2px solid #000;\n  padding: 8px;\n}\nol {\n  margin: 6px 0 6px 16px;\n}\nli {\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n.zmaster .run-head,\n.zmaster .folio {\n  background: #fff;\n  width: fit-content;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n}\n.col-note {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  border-top: 1px dashed #000;\n  padding-top: 4px;\n}",
      "image": null,
      "imageMode": "none",
      "dotSize": 2,
      "columns": 1,
      "useMaster": true,
      "flow": false,
      "bg": 13
    },
    "8": {
      "html": "<h2 class=\"f-mega\" style=\"font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 4px 0 8px;\">MAKE<br>YOUR OWN</h2>\n<div class=\"pat-bar pat-2\"></div>\n<p>Open this file with <b>📂 Load Project</b> and take it apart:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>¶ Story</b> holds the article that flows across pages 2–4.</li>\n<li><b>▤ Master Page</b> draws the running head and the page numbers. The cover and this page have it switched off.</li>\n<li>Each page has its own <b>Custom CSS</b> box.</li>\n<li>Turn on <b>Guides</b> in the preview to see the margins, columns and story area.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"pat-box pat-3\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>THE END</b><br><span class=\"f-term\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">thanks for reading</span></div></div>",
      "css": "p {\n  margin: 6px 0 4px;\n}\nul {\n  margin: 0 0 8px 14px;\n}\nli {\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}",
      "image": null,
      "imageMode": "none",
      "dotSize": 2,
      "columns": 1,
      "useMaster": false,
